{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3370f96c877e463ce8dc176bef323cd9.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3370f96c877e463ce8dc176bef323cd9.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3370f96c877e463ce8dc176bef323cd9.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/8647ef77fdfa2898d87d023eee347d62.avif?t=1770314413\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the adventurer. You are not the hero. You are the skeleton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening in a dark, forgotten chamber, you find yourself lying beside a locked chest\u2014the kind every adventurer dreams of looting. But this time the roles are reversed. You\u2019re the bones on the floor, and the mystery of why you\u2019re here\u2014and how to escape\u2014will take wit, nerve, and a taste for dark humor to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/80e9bd7ad65ea591011d9465c5705603.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/80e9bd7ad65ea591011d9465c5705603.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/80e9bd7ad65ea591011d9465c5705603.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make shapes your fate. Will you claw your way to freedom, uncovering the secrets buried within these walls? Or will you trap yourself forever in the vault, just another cautionary tale for the next adventurer to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stumble upon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3f452431865a872043f40c24355187f8.avif?t=1770314413\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trope turned on its head:</strong> play as the skeleton next to the chest instead of the adventurer looting it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple paths, multiple endings:</strong> escape routes, dead ends, or a fate worse than death\u2014your choices decide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/b7721423da00c3f409b1824ac822f79c.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/b7721423da00c3f409b1824ac822f79c.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/b7721423da00c3f409b1824ac822f79c.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery meets dark comedy:</strong> blend of detective work, eerie atmosphere, and a twisted sense of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable design:</strong> every playthrough reveals new possibilities and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A touch of horror:</strong> lurking tension and unsettling discoveries keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Vault is a story-driven, choice-based mystery with a sharp wit and sinister undertones. The only way forward is through the choices you make. Will you escape the vault\u2026 or become part of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/7b3e9168394170db5c348166b8170d90.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/7b3e9168394170db5c348166b8170d90.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/7b3e9168394170db5c348166b8170d90.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081270?t=1770314413","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081270?t=1770314413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/d5989082e819017eab0aa07ad9fd120c1736ec8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770314413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/d5989082e819017eab0aa07ad9fd120c1736ec8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770314413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4087860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3370f96c877e463ce8dc176bef323cd9.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3370f96c877e463ce8dc176bef323cd9.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3370f96c877e463ce8dc176bef323cd9.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/8647ef77fdfa2898d87d023eee347d62.avif?t=1770314413\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the adventurer. You are not the hero. You are the skeleton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening in a dark, forgotten chamber, you find yourself lying beside a locked chest\u2014the kind every adventurer dreams of looting. But this time the roles are reversed. You\u2019re the bones on the floor, and the mystery of why you\u2019re here\u2014and how to escape\u2014will take wit, nerve, and a taste for dark humor to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/80e9bd7ad65ea591011d9465c5705603.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/80e9bd7ad65ea591011d9465c5705603.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/80e9bd7ad65ea591011d9465c5705603.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make shapes your fate. Will you claw your way to freedom, uncovering the secrets buried within these walls? Or will you trap yourself forever in the vault, just another cautionary tale for the next adventurer to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stumble upon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/3f452431865a872043f40c24355187f8.avif?t=1770314413\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trope turned on its head:</strong> play as the skeleton next to the chest instead of the adventurer looting it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple paths, multiple endings:</strong> escape routes, dead ends, or a fate worse than death\u2014your choices decide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/b7721423da00c3f409b1824ac822f79c.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/b7721423da00c3f409b1824ac822f79c.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/b7721423da00c3f409b1824ac822f79c.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery meets dark comedy:</strong> blend of detective work, eerie atmosphere, and a twisted sense of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable design:</strong> every playthrough reveals new possibilities and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A touch of horror:</strong> lurking tension and unsettling discoveries keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Vault is a story-driven, choice-based mystery with a sharp wit and sinister undertones. The only way forward is through the choices you make. Will you escape the vault\u2026 or become part of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/7b3e9168394170db5c348166b8170d90.poster.avif?t=1770314413\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/7b3e9168394170db5c348166b8170d90.webm?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/extras/7b3e9168394170db5c348166b8170d90.mp4?t=1770314413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Bobi's Heart Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081270/058e79b7aacc64961e8196170f4bf46825939e39/header.jpg?t=1770314413","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS / SteamOS<